LAST_SUCCESS=Task 117 M2 Android MediaCodec player VERIFIED ON PIXEL 2 XL (--no-art): bbb-h264.mp4 plays on screen, HW decode (OMX.qcom.video.decoder.avc) decode-to-surface via present(at-ns)->AMediaCodec_releaseOutputBufferAtTime, REAL-TIME 30fps, behind-ui hole-punch shows video under captions, correct colour. Clean production build (no diagnostics).
NOTES=THREE fixes landed the Android cell:
 1. present-path wiring (src/video.rs mod android): TakenFrame=held MediaCodec output-buffer index + Arc<AtomicBool> liveness; schedule_present->releaseOutputBufferAtTime; submit_for_playback/take_next_decoded/finish_playback(EOS)/seek_reset(flush); drain() bails in playback; Drop flips codec_alive first. Added NDK externs releaseOutputBufferAtTime+flush, BUFFER_FLAG_END_OF_STREAM.
 2. PACING (apps/user/wandr.video.player next_frame_delay 200ms->16ms): on Android present is HW-scheduled (no host SCHEDULED queue / no time_until_next_scheduled), so the guest gets NO independent video wake source; it must request frame-rate cadence itself or it pumps at ~5-16Hz and runs 0.5x. With 16ms: at_ns stable +120-170ms ahead, 30.2/30.0/29.3fps measured.
 3. BEHIND-UI TRANSPARENCY (src/egl.rs +EGL_ALPHA_SIZE,8): standalone EGL config had no alpha -> eglChooseConfig picked RGBX -> Skia transparent clear stored opaque -> hole-punch composited black over video. Adding alpha + existing sf_set_opaque(false) reveals video. Safe: SF layer created eLayerOpaque by default so opaque-clearing apps unaffected.
 ALSO KEEPERS: package.toml android [[mounts]] /data/local/tmp/wandr-samples (device HOME=/ so ~ path absent); player video_rect() helper + on_resize->set_rect live resize reconcile. video_host_impl.rs UNCHANGED.
FOLLOWUP (minor, noted): guest stdout is inherit_stdout (lost on detached Android host) so player println stats invisible on-device; stderr->logcat works. Not fixed (would be a broader change).
DEPLOY: run-hybrid-stack.sh --wandr-only redeploys fresh host+restarts zygote (full script bails on mis-gated ART launcher-resolve). Player --install to /data/local/tmp/wandr-apps. Unlock keyguard via evdev sendevent swipe (adb input is dead under --no-art).
